  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Myself along with a lot of people living in the Oceania region enjoy playing VRChat, and yet, are forced to play the game they enjoy on 170-200 ping minimum.\n\nTo see a change for where an additional Oceania sever is added to the game will be much appreciated from a lot of people. as this can change our experience and make it a whole lot more enjoyable, with the ability to be able to find and chat with people within our region.\n\nThere is no reason why AUNZ servers should be ignored.",
